IP address:

IP address is nothing but a unique address given to each smart device within the Network.
Everydevice inside the network like smart device, smart Fan, mobile phones and smart TV etc.

There are 2 types of IP.
IPV4 32 bit
IPV6 128 bit

In IPV4, there are multiple classes A, B, C, D , E. and each one has its own range 

There is one method caled CIDR, using which we can calculate the IP range shown as /16 or /24.


